      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "帘子里的人",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我不喜欢你身上的味道。",
      "next": "r0086",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0086",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "什么味道。",
      "next": "r0087",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0087",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "帘子里的人",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "摆渡人，我一向不想和你们有所交集。",
      "next": "r0088",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0088",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我不是以摆渡人的身份前来拜见的。",
      "next": "r0089",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0089",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "帘子里的人",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "哦？这么多年了，我还是第一次见不是来找我办公事的摆渡人。",
      "next": "r0090",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0090",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "只是一些个人私情罢了。",
      "next": "r0091",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0091",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "帘子里的人",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "我如何相信？",
      "next": "r0093",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0093",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "赵某不才，世人唤十四。敢问尊姓？",
      "next": "r0094",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0094",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "崔皓。我要找个人。",
      "next": "r0095",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0095",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "三贯六百钱。",
      "next": "r0097",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0097",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "四贯。",
      "next": "r0099",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0099",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不不不，说好的三贯六百，这是那边的规矩。行，你要找谁？",
      "next": "r0100",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0100",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "何素，我的妻子。",
      "next": "r0101",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0101",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "喔……节哀。你想明白了吗，你是摆渡人，你这么做是在打破规矩。",
      "next": "r0102",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0102",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "只是见一面。",
      "next": "r0103",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0103",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那听好了。",
      "next": "r0104",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0104",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "某之所唤者，是为死魂。你是生人，要死魂来见你，这种事情我很久不做了。",
      "next": "r0105",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0105",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "为什么不做了？",
      "next": "r0106",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0106",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "因为见得着，却留不住。世人大多癫狂在这一关，见着一次就想着第二次，再往后的代价可就不是三贯六百钱喽。",
      "next": "r0107",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0107",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那是常人；我只是想弥补一些遗憾。",
      "next": "r0109",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0109",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "她——何素，的旧物，有没有？",
      "next": "r0112",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0112",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不对啊。",
      "next": "r0113",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0113",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "什么？",
      "next": "r0114",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0114",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "该来的应该来了……香火，烛，这信物。",
      "next": "r0115",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0115",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "不应该啊。",
      "next": "r0117",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0117",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "她不在那了。",
      "next": "r0118",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0118",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "你说什么？",
      "next": "r0119",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0119",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "她不在，她走了一趟。",
      "next": "r0120",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0120",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "崔皓",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那她在哪里？",
      "next": "r0122",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0122",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "倒是能算得到。",
      "next": "r0123",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0123",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "长安。仪凤三年，这么久之前的时间……？",
      "next": "r0124",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
      "id": "r0124",
      "revision": 1,
      "kind": "Line",
      "speaker": "",
      "speakerName": "赵十四",
      "side": "Left",
      "expression": "",
      "clearOther": false,
      "text": "那一年的长安。奇怪……她在轮回里，但还没有走出妖界。",
      "next": "r0126",
      "outcome": "",
      "blocking": true,
      "performance": "",
      "choices": []
    },
    {
